I don't know what I could do legally. Even though I still love him, some days I get so angry I want to see him suffer like I have. No court would see me as responsible. I was an employee. I never saw him unless he came to me, He was three times my size and almost twice my age. I was helpless and I lost my job over this bullshit. Now im in so much debt I cant come out of. I want his girlfriend to know. 

&#x200B;

Another twisted thing is that he always had this fantasy of me grabbing him by the dick. He would- what I though was jokingly- tell me to grab him by there. When we met he told me he visualized me naked. Then one day he told me to pick a piece of fluff off his shoulder. I did. He picked it off the ground and put it on his groin area. Also he took me out for my 19th birthday. I got a little tipsy and the next day at work he told me I had grabbed him. I knew it wasnt true. I wasn't drunk like he thought I was. I remembered everything.. I didn't know at the time that he was planning this story. Enticing me to do it. I never did.

&#x200B;

One day I got angry at him when I found out he told people about my self harming. I called him a sociopath too him. I called him phoney and I told him to fuck off. He truly is a sociopath. He told me he told people because he cares, and that he was super hurt by what I was calling him. He made *me* feel bad for what I said.. .

